---
import Link from '@/components/Link.astro';
import { SOCIALS } from '@/config';
---

<section class="mt-16">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">About me</h2>
  <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
    <p>
      I like to spend my time with family and friends, and enjoy good times,
      bad jokes, hot coffee, and cold beer. When I'm not working or hanging
      out with my lovely girlfriend, I can be found playing pool or disc golf.
    </p>
    <p>
      At work I manage all of the web and marketing operations for our Amazon
      and Shopify based business. Sometimes I'm creating marketing strategies,
      others I'm helping develop new products. Then there's the times that
      I'll have to put out a fire because some online service doesn't want to
      work (I don't blame them, I really don't either). 😜
    </p>
    <p>
      In the free-ish time that I can find I like to blog about iPhone and Mac
      apps, among other topics that interest me, and build cool things with
      the <Link
        href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/shortcuts/id915249334"
        class="text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-500 dark:text-primary-400"
      >iOS Shortcuts app</Link>, some of which you can find on my <Link
        href={SOCIALS.routinehub}
        class="text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-500 dark:text-primary-400"
      >RoutineHub page</Link>.
    </p>
    <p>
      I love chatting about e-commerce, marketing, Shopify, and anything tech
      related really. So hit me up if you'd like! 🤙
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
